
startは起動
stopは停止
restartは再起動
statusは状態
enableは自動起動on
disableはoff

switch_monitor.service：

sudo systemctl start switch_monitor.service
sudo systemctl stop switch_monitor.service
sudo systemctl restart switch_monitor.service
sudo systemctl status switch_monitor.service

robot_run.service：

sudo systemctl start robot_run.service
sudo systemctl stop robot_run.service
sudo systemctl restart robot_run.service
sudo systemctl status robot_run.service

自動起動のON/OFFはこれです。

sudo systemctl enable switch_monitor.service
sudo systemctl disable switch_monitor.service
sudo systemctl enable robot_run.service
sudo systemctl disable robot_run.service
